WEBVTT
NOTE smp12-v3-1-2 en — narration replaced (user, 2026-10-20: new Fahad voice-over); timed to the new speech by silence; check by eye

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.260
The matches are played in three cities.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:08.170
Riyadh has five stadiums, including the main venue, King Fahd Sports City.

3
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.830
Jeddah has two, led by King Abdullah Sports City.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.690
And Al Khobar has a brand-new stadium.

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.410
Tap each one.

6
00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.910
You'll see they are very different sizes.

7
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.040
In a big stadium, crowds build up faster and queues are longer.

8
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.810
In a smaller one, the spaces are tighter.

9
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:34.830
Wherever you are posted, you will learn your own venue in detail in Lesson 3.1.
